{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1027065-razor-bow-elven-questions-pathfinder","id":1027065,"title":"Razor bow, elven questions (pathfinder)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scarred Lands"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-05T09:01:31-08:00","id":1027065,"title":"Razor bow, elven questions (pathfinder)","content":"So I have a few questions, do feats like weapon focus/specialization affect both the bow and melee aspects of this Weapon? Are the blades and arrows considered different weapon groups for the weapon training fighter ability? Is it available as a Composite Bow? Does the feat Point Blank Shot affect melee damage done with the bow?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":398,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/398-rat_bastard","user":"rat_bastard","date":". 01-05-2017, 12:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/398-rat_bastard","name":"rat_bastard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar398_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T07:32:08-08:00","id":1029048,"title":"","content":"I would say Weapon Focus/Specialization feats apply to a single weapon, so I'd give the bonus for both melee and ranged. The razor bow trades a standard elf's potentially higher damage with a longbow or longsword for versatility in melee and ranged, so allowing these feats shouldn't be overpowered and is in keeping with the purpose of the weapon. <br /> <br /> However, for fighter weapon training, you're talking about broad groups of weapons, not focusing on just one, so I would say two separate categories: light blades for melee and bows for ranged. <br /> <br /> The razor bow is not available as a composite bow, RAW, but that's up to your GM. <br /> <br /> Point Blank Shot should apply only to ranged attacks with the razor bow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12432-scott-holden","name":"Scott Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12432_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}